OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785746891
OL,3,CSome passengers allowed to drop off
OL,4,Chold luggage early at Jersey Airport
OL,6,FSome passengers travelling through
OL,7,FJersey Airport will be able to drop
OL,8,Ftheir hold luggage off the evening
OL,9,Fbefore their flight.
OL,11,FThe new system, which comes in from
OL,12,FThursday 30 July, will allow British
OL,13,FAirways passengers flying to London
OL,14,FHeathrow to check in their bags at the
OL,15,Fisland's airport between 4:30pm and
OL,16,F8pm, as long as their flight is before
OL,17,F12 noon the following day.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
