OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,360,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785746891
OL,3,CSome passengers allowed to drop off
OL,4,Chold luggage early at Jersey Airport
OL,6,FThe announcement comes after a number
OL,7,Fof travellers missed their flights
OL,8,Fearlier this week due to issues with
OL,9,Fstaffing at security leading to long
OL,10,Fqueues.
OL,12,FPorts of Jersey say allowing
OL,13,Ftravellers to drop off their bags
OL,14,Fearly will help them "avoid the
OL,15,Fmorning rush", given the airport opens
OL,16,Fits doors at 5:30am, with the first
OL,17,Fflights often taking off around 7am.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,360,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785746891
OL,3,CSome passengers allowed to drop off
OL,4,Chold luggage early at Jersey Airport
OL,6,FJamie Loudon, Head of Terminal and
OL,7,FTransformation at Jersey Airport,
OL,8,Fsaid: "Twilight Bag Drop is about
OL,9,Fmaking travel easier and more
OL,10,Fconvenient for our customers.
OL,12,F"By giving passengers the option to
OL,13,Fcheck in and drop off their hold
OL,14,Fluggage the evening before travel, it
OL,15,Fprovides greater flexibility and
OL,16,Fremoves part of the airport journey
OL,17,Ffrom the day of departure.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,360,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785746891
OL,3,CSome passengers allowed to drop off
OL,4,Chold luggage early at Jersey Airport
OL,6,F"Customers can arrive at the airport
OL,7,Fknowing their bags have already been
OL,8,Fprocessed, giving them more time to
OL,9,Frelax and focus on the start of their
OL,10,Ftrip."
OL,12,FIt is hoped the service will be
OL,13,Fparticularly useful for families,
OL,14,Flarger groups and those with multiple
OL,15,Fbags or sports equipment.
OL,17,FTravellers looking to use the early
OL,18,Fbag drop must already be checked in
OL,19,Fonline and can use the free 30-minute
OL,20,Fparking in the airport's long stay
OL,21,Farea.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,360,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785746891
OL,3,CSome passengers allowed to drop off
OL,4,Chold luggage early at Jersey Airport
OL,6,FThe lead passenger on a booking can
OL,7,Fcheck in all hold luggage for a group
OL,8,Fbut needs to bring ID for each person.
OL,10,FThere are plans to extend this service
OL,11,Fto cover other routes and airlines in
OL,12,Fthe future, while more information can
OL,13,Fbe found here.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/5
